This aircraft is derived from the "quadtailsitter" simulation model that ships with
PX4-Autopilot (Tools/simulation/gz/models/quadtailsitter), a model of the HEQ Swan K1
quad tailsitter, and carries that model's geometry, mass, motor cant and aerodynamic
data. The meshes are the source model's own, converted to glTF and recoloured after the
manufacturer's photographs.

The upstream model is distributed under the BSD 3-Clause License; see LICENSE in
this folder for its text and copyright notice.

  https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot

The propeller thrust and power tables are taken from the UIUC Propeller Data Site
(Brandt, Deters, Ananda, Dantsker and Selig), APC 9x6E wind-tunnel measurements.

  https://m-selig.ae.illinois.edu/props/propDB.html
